"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nWas really thirsty at the time and spotted this well-known yogurt ice cream shop, so we went in.\n\nThe owner immediately asked if it was our first visit.  \nWhen we said yes, they welcomed us warmly and offered to let us sample a few flavors.  \nWe tried a little of each and they kindly explained how the ordering system works.\n\n\nThe system is simple:  \ngrab a cup, fill it with as much yogurt as you like in any flavor combination,  \nchoose your toppings, and it's charged by weight.\n\nWe're not big topping people so we kept it simple.  \nThe taste was classic yogurt — exactly as expected — and being so thirsty at the time, we finished it in no time.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n"